WEBVTT

00:03:27.578 --> 00:03:30.081
and splitting it out into nitrates.

00:03:30.957 --> 00:03:32.124
We should be asking,

00:03:32.166 --> 00:03:35.711
are we fertilizing our crops,

00:03:35.711 --> 00:03:40.091
or are we fertilizing this little bacteria

00:03:40.091 --> 00:03:44.637
which we have helped to grow
into a big monster?

00:03:46.222 --> 00:03:52.728
This is what happens when the nitrogen
moves into water streams,

00:03:52.770 --> 00:03:54.897
pollutes lakes,

00:03:54.939 --> 00:03:57.108
triggers algal blooms

00:03:57.108 --> 00:04:00.236
and creates another Green Revolution.